  "html": "<div class=\"mw-content-ltr mw-parser-output\" lang=\"en\" dir=\"ltr\"><p>An <b>associated state</b> is the minor partner in a formal, free relationship between a political territory with a degree of statehood and the <a href=\"/wiki/United_States\" class=\"mw-redirect\" title=\"United States\">United States</a>, for which no other specific term, such as protectorate, is adopted. The details of such free association are contained in the Treaty of San Juan, Article X, and the Associated Statehood Act of 2139 and are specific to the countries involved. Free associated states can be described as independent or not, but free association is not a qualification of an entity's statehood or status as a subject of international law.\n</p><p><br />\n</p>\n<h2><span class=\"mw-headline\" id=\"States_in_a_formal_association\">States in a formal association</span><span class=\"mw-editsection\"><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">[</span><a title=\"Sign in to edit\" class=\"mw-editsection-visualeditor\" data-tracking-label=\"log-in-edit-section\" data-action=\"edit-section\" href=\"https://auth.fandom.com/signin?redirect=https%3A%2F%2Fsecond-renaissance.fandom.com%2Fwiki%2FAssociated_state%3Fveaction%3Dedit%26section%3D1&amp;uselang=en&amp;metadata=article-registration-edit-article-section\" data-auth-modal=\"signin\" data-testid=\"log-in-edit-section\" aria-label=\"Sign in to edit\"><svg class=\"wds-icon wds-icon-tiny\" aria-hidden=\"true\" focusable=\"false\"><use xlink:href=\"#wds-icons-pencil-tiny\"></use></svg></a><span class=\"mw-editsection-bracket\">]</span></span></h2>\n<table class=\"wikitable\">\n<tbody><tr>\n<th width=\"160px\">Minor partner\n</th>\n<th class=\"unsortable\" width=\"200px\">Associated since\n</th>\n<th class=\"unsortable\">Level of association\n</th>\n<th class=\"unsortable\">International status\n</th></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/d/d8/East_Asia_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/23?cb=20170812182619\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"23\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"East Asia Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"East_Asia_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></span></span>&#160;</span><a href=\"/wiki/Association_of_East-Asia\" title=\"Association of East-Asia\">Association of East-Asia</a>\n</td>\n<td>2140\n</td>\n<td>United States provides defense, funding grants, integration into the Quantum Economic Model, and access to U.S. social services for citizens of these areas under the Compact of Free Association.\n</td>\n<td>Independence in foreign relations recognized per the London Accords.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/1/12/European_Association.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/23?cb=20170817172319\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"23\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"European Association.png\" data-image-key=\"European_Association.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></span></span>&#160;</span><a href=\"/wiki/European_Association\" title=\"European Association\">European Association</a>\n</td>\n<td>2139\n</td>\n<td>United States provides defense, funding grants, integration into the Quantum Economic Model, and access to U.S. social services for citizens of these areas under the Compact of Free Association.\n</td>\n<td>Independence in foreign relations recognized per the London Accords.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/b/b5/Trans-siberia.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/23?cb=20170817223636\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"23\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element\" data-image-name=\"Trans-siberia.png\" data-image-key=\"Trans-siberia.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" /></span></span>&#160;</span><a href=\"/wiki/Trans-Siberia\" title=\"Trans-Siberia\">Trans-Siberia</a>\n</td>\n<td>2141\n</td>\n<td>United States provides defense, funding grants, integration into the Quantum Economic Model, and access to U.S. social services for citizens of these areas under the Compact of Free Association.\n</td>\n<td>Independence in foreign relations recognized per the London Accords.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"23\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"African Commonwealth Flag.png\" data-image-key=\"African_Commonwealth_Flag.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocookie.net/second-renaissance/images/d/da/African_Commonwealth_Flag.png/revision/latest/scale-to-width-down/23?cb=20170610150639\" /></span></span>&#160;</span><a href=\"/wiki/African_Commonwealth\" title=\"African Commonwealth\">African Commonwealth</a>\n</td>\n<td>2152\n</td>\n<td>United States provides defense, funding grants, integration into the Quantum Economic Model, and access to U.S. social services for citizens of these areas under the Compact of Free Association.\n</td>\n<td>Independence in foreign relations recognized per the London Accords.\n</td></tr>\n<tr>\n<td><span class=\"flagicon\"><span class=\"mw-image-border\" typeof=\"mw:File\"><span><img alt=\"\" src=\"data:image/gif;base64,R0lGODlhAQABAIABAAAAAP///yH5BAEAAAEALAAAAAABAAEAQAICTAEAOw%3D%3D\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" width=\"23\" height=\"15\" class=\"mw-file-element lazyload\" data-image-name=\"Central Eurasian Union.png\" data-image-key=\"Central_Eurasian_Union.png\" data-relevant=\"1\" data-src=\"https://static.wikia.nocooki